3232@sb.go.kr)<br/><br/>   ○ 심사방법: 주민자치회 심의 후 개별통보<br/><br/>   * 자세한 사항은 붙임 파일 참고<br/><br/><br/><br/>2. 공고기간: 2026.9. 18(금) ~ 2026. 10. 2 (금)<br/><br/>3. 공고방법: 홈페이지 게시판 게시<br/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"row mt50\">\n<div class=\"col-24\">\n<a class=\"btn link large\" href=\"https://www.sb.go.kr/www/selectEminwonList.do?key=6123&amp;notAncmtSeCode=&amp;searchCnd2=&amp;depNm=보문동&amp;pageUnit=10&amp;searchCnd=dong&amp;searchKrwd=&amp;pageIndex=1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">목록</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","files":[{"name":"자치회관 프로그램 강사모집 공고문 2026 4분기.pdf","url":"https://eminwon.sb.go.kr/emwp/jsp/ofr/FileDownNew.jsp?user_file_nm=%ec%9e%90%ec%b9%98%ed%9a%8c%ea%b4%80+%ed%94%84%eb%a1%9c%ea%b7%b8%eb%9e%a8+%ea%b0%95%ec%82%ac%eb%aa%a8%ec%a7%91+%ea%b3%b5%ea%b3%a0%eb%ac%b8+2026+4%eb%b6%84%ea%b8%b0.pdf&sys_file_nm=%ec%9e%90%ec%b9%98%ed%9a%8c%ea%b4%80+%ed%94%84%eb%a1%9c%ea%b7%b8%eb%9e%a8+%ea%b0%95%ec%82%ac%eb%aa%a8%ec%a7%91+%ea%b3%b5%ea%b3%a0%eb%ac%b8+2026+4%eb%b6%84%ea%b8%b0_ofr_ofr_b%40I_%40gOWrQ3wSwBv_20260917104926987_2.pdf&file_path=%2fntishome%2ffile%2fupload%2fofr%2fofr%2f20260917"},{"name":"신청서식(강사지원신청서 및 강의계획서).hwpx","url":"https://eminwon.sb.go.kr/emwp/jsp/ofr/FileDownNew.jsp?user_file_nm=%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c%ec%8b%9d(%ea%b0%95%ec%82%ac%ec%a7%80%ec%9b%90%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c+%eb%b0%8f+%ea%b0%95%ec%9d%98%ea%b3%84%ed%9a%8d%ec%84%9c).hwpx&sys_file_nm=%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c%ec%8b%9d(%ea%b0%95%ec%82%ac%ec%a7%80%ec%9b%90%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c+%eb%b0%8f+%ea%b0%95%ec%9d%98%ea%b3%84%ed%9a%8d%ec%84%9c)_ofr_ofr_b%40I_%40gOWrQ3wSwBv_20260917104926987_3.hwpx&file_path=%2fntishome%2ffile%2fupload%2fofr%2fofr%2f20260918"},{"name":"신청서식(강사지원신청서 및 강의계획서).pdf","url":"https://eminwon.sb.go.kr/emwp/jsp/ofr/FileDownNew.jsp?user_file_nm=%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c%ec%8b%9d(%ea%b0%95%ec%82%ac%ec%a7%80%ec%9b%90%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c+%eb%b0%8f+%ea%b0%95%ec%9d%98%ea%b3%84%ed%9a%8d%ec%84%9c).pdf&sys_file_nm=%ec%8b%a0%ec%b2%ad%ec%84%9c%ec%8b%